@startuml
title Activity 05 - Create and Save Purchase Request Draft

|Requester|
start
:Open Purchasing > Creation;
:Select department and required date;
:Add item row;
:Choose category and unit;
:Enter quantity, unit price and justification;
:Attach optional image or document;
|Frontend|
:Calculate line total and request total;
:Validate draft-safe fields;
if (Save Draft clicked?) then (yes)
  :Generate localId;
  :Serialize request payload with status = DRAFT;
  :Save local draft;
  :Queue workflow sync;
  |Backend|
  :Persist purchase-request record;
  if (Storage succeeds?) then (yes)
    |Frontend|
    :Show draft saved;
    :Keep draft in requester list;
    stop
  else (no)
    |Frontend|
    :Keep local copy and show sync warning;
    stop
  endif
else (continue editing)
  :Return to form;
  stop
endif
@enduml
